From: MATYJAGUZ075 <matyjaguz075@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CameraService: make getLegacyParametersLazy more lenient

On some HAL1 setups with the A12-style CameraService reverted codebase,
initializeShimMetadata can fail and getLegacyParametersLazy returns
ERROR_INVALID_OPERATION "Unable to initialize legacy parameters".
CameraX (A13) calls this path and fails to initialize, crashing the
camera app (Aperture) with CameraAccessException.

Be lenient: if initialization fails or leaves no parameters, return OK
with empty parameters instead of failing. This allows CameraX to fall
back to other paths.
---
diff --git a/services/camera/libcameraservice/CameraService.cpp b/services/camera/libcameraservice/CameraService.cpp
index xxxxxxx..yyyyyyy 100644
--- a/services/camera/libcameraservice/CameraService.cpp
+++ b/services/camera/libcameraservice/CameraService.cpp
@@ -1098,7 +1098,7 @@
         /*out*/
         CameraParameters* parameters) {
 
-    ALOGV("%s: for cameraId: %d", __FUNCTION__, cameraId);
+    ALOGI("%s: for cameraId: %d", __FUNCTION__, cameraId);
 
     Status ret = Status::ok();
 
@@ -1130,8 +1130,11 @@
     ret = initializeShimMetadata(cameraId);
     CameraThreadState::restoreCallingIdentity(token);
     if (!ret.isOk()) {
-        // Error already logged by callee
-        return ret;
+        // Be lenient: HAL1 or legacy setup may not support shim metadata
+        // initialization. Continue with empty parameters so CameraX can
+        // fall back to other paths.
+        ALOGW("%s: initializeShimMetadata failed for camera %d: %s, continuing with empty params",
+              __FUNCTION__, cameraId, ret.toString8().string());
     }
 
     // Check for parameters again
@@ -1151,9 +1154,10 @@
         }
     }
 
-    ALOGE("%s: Parameters were not initialized, or were empty.  Device may not be present.",
+    ALOGW("%s: Parameters were not initialized, or were empty. Returning empty parameters.",
             __FUNCTION__);
-    return STATUS_ERROR(ERROR_INVALID_OPERATION, "Unable to initialize legacy parameters");
+    *parameters = CameraParameters();
+    return Status::ok();
 }
 
 // Can camera service trust the caller based on the calling UID?
